      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "No other restrictions in eligibility criteria were applied.",
      "reason": "The evidence indicates there were no additional eligibility restrictions beyond those listed, but it does not provide rationales for any notable restrictions on study eligibility."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 62
